// Applications plugin — the launcher proper, replacing rofi's drun mode.
//
// desktop_actions exposes the "New Window"-style entries that live inside a
// .desktop file, which rofi's drun matched too.
//
// hide_description keeps rows to one line so the list stays as compact as the
// rofi one was; the description is only shown for other plugins, where it
// carries information (a calculator result, an action's command).
//
// terminal: rofi was configured with `terminal: "kitty"` so that any desktop
// entry marked Terminal=true opens in kitty. Without this anyrun falls back to
// a hardcoded list of terminals that does not include kitty.

Config(
    desktop_actions: true,
    max_entries: 8,
    hide_description: true,

    terminal: Some(Terminal(
        command: "kitty",
        args: "-e {}",
    )),
)
